OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWho were the seven killed in
OL,4,Awrong-way crash?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers had been pursuing the car for
OL,7,Falmost seven minutes after it was
OL,8,Fconnected to earlier alleged criminal
OL,9,Factivity, but the pursuit was abandoned
OL,10,F10 seconds before the crash when the
OL,11,FPassat turned on to the dual
OL,12,Fcarriageway, the Independent Office for
OL,13,FPolice Conduct (IOPC) said.
OL,15,FWhen someone dies following police
OL,16,Fcontact, it is mandatory for the case
OL,17,Fto be referred to the IOPC to
OL,18,Finvestigate.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
